<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1900s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 20th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1900s, 1,353 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 518 were founded and 1,166 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the United States, the British Empire and the Soviet Union.</p></header>
